**/.cache/

# ==============================================================================
# Python
# ==============================================================================

## Virtual Environments
# Standard venvs (.venv, .venv-pyright, .venv-ci-black, etc.)
**/.venv*/

# TODO(sergiitk): update all references below to produce standard `.venv-*`
# User virtualenv dirs (src/python/CONTRIBUTING.md -> ~/.virtualenvs/)
**/.virtualenv*/
# Legacy venv directory names (build_artifact_python.sh, build_python.sh -> venv/)
**/venv/
# Script virtualenvs (tools/distrib/python/docgen.py -> distrib_virtualenv/)
**/*_virtualenv/
# Bazel format virtualenv (tools/distrib/format_bazel.sh -> bazel_format_virtual_environment/)
**/*_virtual_environment/

## Bytecode & Caches
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.pytype/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

## Test Coverage Data
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*

## Build Artifacts & Packages
**/pyb/
**/.eggs/
**/*.egg
**/*.egg-info/

